{
   "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
   "format-version": "0.1",
   "name": "nf-core/rnaseq 3.27.0 default-route projection (star_salmon + trimgalore + salmon)",
   "annotation": "Concrete projection of galaxy-workflow-draft.gxwf.yml for the default test route: trimmer=trimgalore, aligner=star_salmon, pseudo_aligner=salmon, PE reads, no UMI, no rRNA removal, no BBSplit, markduplicates on. Deferred steps (capability gaps, see open-requirements.ledger.yml) and degenerate fan-ins are collapsed to the taken branch. 12 of the draft outputs are reachable; deseq2_qc needs factor metadata the interface does not carry.",
